{"lyrics":"[00:01.88]Ayy, huh, hey\n[00:02.56]Baby, I'm too high, I ain't wanna fuck, no way\n[00:08.72]Way too high (Smokin' Cookie Crisp, woo), ya' dig?\n[00:13.34]Baby, I'm too high, I ain't wanna fuck, no way (I ain't wanna fuck, no)\n[00:15.70]Bitch, you got some nerve, claimin' that you know me (Claimin' that you know me)\n[00:18.74]Nigga, you got some nerve, claimin' that I owe you (Got some fuckin' nerve)\n[00:21.44]You ain't know the secret to the drip 'til I showed you, ayy (Ayy)\n[00:25.26]Fresh out the bank, run up on me, then get hit with a bang, ayy (Ayy)\n[00:28.34]Drive away, he got crucified today, ayy (Ayy)\n[00:31.46]Don't cross me, you don't want smoke, ayy (Woah-woah-woah, ayy)\n[00:34.20]If you're crossin' my streets, better look both ways (Both ways)\n[00:37.68]Uh, got my cash up (Got my cash, cash-cash-cash)\n[00:40.28]Tell them fuck niggas catch up (Tell them fuck boys catch)\n[00:42.96]Too bad, they can't catch us (Too bad, they can't catch)\n[00:47.00]He alone, he need backup (He alone, he alone)\n[00:49.50]Choppa back him up, he got his back to the wall (Choppa back him-)\n[00:52.38]I just saw you kissin' that bitch, she had her tongue on my balls (Ayy-ayy, tounge)\n[00:55.44]I was into Xanax and Percocet's, she love Adderall (Ayy-ayy, she loves-)\n[00:58.42]She was knockin' on my nerves, told that bitch to knock it off, ayy (Bitch, knock it off)\n[01:02.96]Crossin' my streets, both ways (Bitch, knock it off)\n[01:05.74]You a broke nigga and I'm too paid, ayy (Bitch, knock it off, yeah)\n[01:09.58]Ballin' like a toupée (Just knock it off, yeah)\n[01:12.38]Kick, push, start shit, Lupe (Lupe, woah)\n[01:14.34]Baby, I'm too high, I ain't wanna fuck, no way (I ain't wanna fuck, no)\n[01:17.24]Bitch, you got some nerve, claimin' that you know me (Claimin' that you know me)\n[01:20.28]Nigga, you got some nerve, claimin' that I owe you (Got some fuckin' nerve)\n[01:22.98]You ain't know the secret to the drip 'til I showed you, ayy (Ayy)\n[01:26.80]Fresh out the bank, run up on me, then get hit with a bang, ayy (Ayy)\n[01:29.88]Drive away, he got crucified today, ayy (Ayy)\n[01:33.00]Don't cross me, you don't want smoke, ayy (Woah-woah-woah, ayy)\n[01:35.72]If you're crossin' my streets, better look both ways (Both ways)\n[01:38.76]I ain't gon' lie, fuck me for this Dolce\n[01:41.48]You could do me for the Dior next Thursday\n[01:44.32]She sucked me at the front door, that's foreplay\n[01:47.60]Left my condoms at the crib, but what am I to run for?\n[01:50.78]I don't even run from niggas, that's what I got a gun for\n[01:53.76]Too many fuck niggas in the world, that's what I killed your son for\n[01:56.82]Try to intercept my money, dummy, then you done for\n[01:59.94]All I care about is money, honey, I don't love whores, ayy\n[02:03.74]New gun I can't wait to use, bitches, I won't wait for you\n[02:06.86]Hit him in his brain, now his shit look like baby food\n[02:09.94]Bitch, I'm not erasin' you, I'm really replacin' you\n[02:13.00]Bad bitch in my room, there's some things I can't wait to do\n[02:16.06]Liquor and exotic hoes, I'm tryna live in the moment\n[02:18.78]In the studio, my phone on silent, ho, I gotta stay focused\n[02:21.82]Fuck with me and it get violent, ho, violent, ho\n[02:24.88]Kill you, then I fuck your bitch, huh, vámonos\n[02:27.16]Baby, I'm too high, I ain't wanna fuck, no way (I ain't wanna fuck, no)\n[02:31.08]Bitch, you got some nerve, claimin' that you know me (Claimin' that you know me)\n[02:34.14]Nigga, you got some nerve, claimin' that I owe you (Got some fuckin' nerve)\n[02:36.82]You ain't know the secret to the drip 'til I showed you, ayy (Ayy)\n[02:40.64]Fresh out the bank, run up on me, then get hit with a bang, ayy (Ayy)\n[02:43.72]Drive away, he got crucified today, ayy (Ayy)\n[02:46.86]Don't cross me, you don't want smoke, ayy (Woah-woah-woah, ayy)\n[02:49.56]If you're crossin' my streets, better look both ways (Both ways)","words":[[1.88,2.12,"Ayy,"],[2.24,2.32,"huh,"],[2.